fika-force-field 1 ahlstrom polarizable
# Polarizable water of P. Ahlstrom, A. Wallqvist, S. Engstrom and B. Jonsson, Mol. Phys. 68, 563
# (1989): point charges (e) on O, H, H and an isotropic polarizability (a.u., 1.44 A^3) on O.

residue hoh 3
charges
1 -0.669
2  0.3345
3  0.3345
polarizabilities isotropic 1
1 9.718
end
